024-martin-county-voters-approved-a-half-cent-sales-tax-for-conservation-two-years-later-more-than-2000-acres-are-protected-and-eight-more-properties-are-being-pursued/articleshow/133629768.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T21:02:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133629799,imgsize-125629.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Built in 1928, this $5.8M Dallas castle is now going to auction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133656445.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Château des Grotteaux mansion is set for auction after nearly a year on the market, with bids starting at around two million dollars—significantly lower than its original asking price. This enchanting Dallas property features modern updates while maintaining its fairy-tale charm. The auction will conclude on September twenty-ninth, targeting buyers who cherish distinctiveness over mere historical value.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/built-in-1928-and-bought-by-a-future-dallas-mayor-this-french-style-castle-was-doubled-in-size-98-years-later-its-heading-to-auction-after-a-5-8m-listing/articleshow/133656445.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/built-in-1928-and-bought-by-a-future-dallas-mayor-this-french-style-castle-was-doubled-in-size-98-years-later-its-heading-to-auction-after-a-5-8m-listing/articleshow/133656445.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T20:36:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133656706,imgsize-466391.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan's AQI hit 616 as Ontario wildfire smoke crossed into the US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133652330.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/michigans-aqi-hit-616-after-ontario-wildfire-smoke-crossed-into-the-us-scientists-warn-a-warming-climate-could-make-such-pollution-more-common/articleshow/133652330.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/michigans-aqi-hit-616-after-ontario-wildfire-smoke-crossed-into-the-us-scientists-warn-a-warming-climate-could-make-such-pollution-more-common/articleshow/133652330.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T21:20:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133652566,imgsize-58738.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists reconstruct face of 'Conquest Man,' skeleton from 1079 burial]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133651112.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Buried around 1079, Conquest Man's identity has been revealed through scientific analysis. His ancestry offers insights into his journey across Europe, showcasing a unique blend of Scandinavian artifacts with those linked to a Norman church. This finding complicates the simplistic Saxon versus Norman narrative, emphasizing resilience and adaptability in the aftermath of the Norman Conquest.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/scientists-reconstructed-the-face-of-conquest-man-a-1000-year-old-skeleton-buried-just-13-years-after-the-norman-conquest/articleshow/133651112.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/scientists-reconstructed-the-face-of-conquest-man-a-1000-year-old-skeleton-buried-just-13-years-after-the-norman-conquest/articleshow/133651112.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T18:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133651253,imgsize-1057766.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nepal tragedy: Owners missing, dog refuses to leave flood-hit Trishuli home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133655596.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A black-and-white dog remains at the site of four homes destroyed by a flood.  He refuses to leave the muddy patch where his home once stood.  Rescue workers and JCBs clear debris around the steadfast canine.  Volunteers offer food and water, which he accepts quietly when alone.  Displaced residents understand his loyalty to his former territory.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-tragedy-owners-missing-dog-refuses-to-leave-flood-hit-trishuli-home/articleshow/133655596.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-tragedy-owners-missing-dog-refuses-to-leave-flood-hit-trishuli-home/articleshow/133655596.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T20:08:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vishant Agarwala</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133656104,imgsize-266014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New visa, Green Card rules coming into effect from September 2026: Is the 75-country ban lifted?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133656076.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-visa-green-card-rules-coming-into-effect-from-september-2026-is-the-75-country-ban-lifted/articleshow/133656076.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-visa-green-card-rules-coming-into-effect-from-september-2026-is-the-75-country-ban-lifted/articleshow/133656076.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T20:11:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133656113,imgsize-57126.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin taxi driver Gurmeet Singh stripped of US citizenship 15 years after rape conviction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133655724.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-taxi-driver-gurmeet-singh-stripped-of-us-citizenship-15-years-after-rape-conviction/articleshow/133655724.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-taxi-driver-gurmeet-singh-stripped-of-us-citizenship-15-years-after-rape-conviction/articleshow/133655724.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T20:05:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133656025,imgsize-140706.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Tennessee man left a late-1700s house and about $500,000 to local government for a park]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133654682.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A historic home in Tennessee, along with $500,000, has been returned to its rightful family after local officials failed to fulfill the promise of establishing a public park as per the will. After a decade of inactivity, the descendant will take charge of crucial repairs and preservation efforts for the old house, shedding light on the complexities of municipal management involving donated heritage properties.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-tennessee-man-left-a-late-1700s-house-and-about-500000-to-local-government-for-a-park-after-nearly-a-decade-of-delays-the-property-and-money-are-going-to-a-descendant/articleshow/133654682.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-tennessee-man-left-a-late-1700s-house-and-about-500000-to-local-government-for-a-park-after-nearly-a-decade-of-delays-the-property-and-money-are-going-to-a-descendant/articleshow/133654682.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T19:50:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133655131,imgsize-2298305.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: Drone accidentally captures catastrophic avalanche on Mount Langtang in Nepal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133654471.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/watch-drone-accidentally-captures-catastrophic-avalanche-on-mount-langtang-in-nepal/articleshow/133654471.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/watch-drone-accidentally-captures-catastrophic-avalanche-on-mount-langtang-in-nepal/articleshow/133654471.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T19:20:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133654918,imgsize-13376448.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Vanished Texas bird island is back, with 2,500 pairs of birds]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133654063.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After years of erosion and extreme weather, Dickinson Bay's lost islands have seen a remarkable revival. Spearheaded by the Galveston Bay Foundation and U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service, habitat restoration efforts have successfully created new nesting habitats for over 2,500 pairs of waterbirds. This revitalization not only boosts local biodiversity but also creates job opportunities and enhances economic activity through recreational fishing and improved oyster reefs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-the-1930s-texas-built-3-bird-nesting-islands-from-dredged-mud-all-vanished-but-one-rebuilt-4-5-acre-island-now-hosts-more-than-2500-nesting-pairs/articleshow/133654063.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-the-1930s-texas-built-3-bird-nesting-islands-from-dredged-mud-all-vanished-but-one-rebuilt-4-5-acre-island-now-hosts-more-than-2500-nesting-pairs/articleshow/133654063.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T18:45:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133654152,imgsize-607633.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['This well is not to be built over': A California ranch was warned 20 years ago; young teens are now suffering from a rare cancer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133653567.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-well-is-not-to-be-built-over-a-california-ranch-was-warned-20-years-ago-young-teens-there-are-suffering-from-a-rare-cancer/articleshow/133653567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-well-is-not-to-be-built-over-a-california-ranch-was-warned-20-years-ago-young-teens-there-are-suffering-from-a-rare-cancer/articleshow/133653567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T18:18:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133653619,imgsize-222018.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Italy population to shrink by nearly 4 million by 2050 as ageing accelerates]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133653249.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Italy's population is projected to significantly decrease by 2050.  Birth rates remain low, while the elderly population is expected to grow.  This demographic shift will create new economic and welfare system challenges.  Southern regions anticipate the most substantial population losses across the country.  Immigration has previously helped stabilize the population figures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/italy-population-to-shrink-by-nearly-4-million-by-2050-as-ageing-accelerates-report/articleshow/133653249.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/italy-population-to-shrink-by-nearly-4-million-by-2050-as-ageing-accelerates-report/articleshow/133653249.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-31T18:10:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133653454,imgsize-160028.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Oregon farmer grows crops for 40 years without irrigation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133649121.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-oregon-farmer-grew-tomatoes-potatoes-squash-garlic-and-beans-for-